-- Red flash on damage: a fighter turns red as a silhouette of his own sprite
-- (tex_tint) and fades back over hurt_fade seconds (tick_hurt_fades in
-- combat/battle_damage.ds). The peak is weak (28 per cent) and the fade
-- (0.15 s) is well under the punch cooldown (0.3 s), so a fighter never looks
-- solid red: a burst of hits gives short blinks instead of a second of red.
public number hurt_rgb=0x00FF2020, hurt_alpha=0.75, hurt_fade=0.15
