-- Epilepsy warning: it no longer hides on a timer. The screen stays until the
-- player presses the consent button (legal_accept), so the warning cannot be
-- missed: entering the game means accepting the risk. The button is at full
-- brightness from the start but ignores taps while warn_t counts down (3-2-1 in
-- its label); when the count ends the seconds disappear and the button works.
-- The press is stamped in settings.dat, and the system Back button exits.
public number warn_open=1, warn_a=1, warn_ready=0, warn_t=0, warn_wait=3
-- After consent the whole warning screen fades out; warn_open stays set until
-- the animation ends so taps during it do nothing.
public number warn_closing=0, warn_close_t=0, warn_fade=1.25
-- Outline thickness of the consent button. The stroke sits outside the edge
-- (roundrect_outline in core/ui.ds), so the button looks the same as it did
-- with the old white rectangle slightly larger than the fill.
public number warn_frame_th=2
